encial","guid":"_c9L-a2WTgm4JfSOBWVugA","children":[{"id":"81","parent":"80","text":"Depresión (\"pseudodemencia depresiva\")","guid":"YMlWiC3-See66Dh_ZZZESg","children":[{"id":"82","parent":"81","text":"Quejas prominentes del PACIENTE","guid":"G3kp-AHTRf2bj1qouhNoVA","children":[]},{"id":"83","parent":"81","text":"Poco esfuerzo en test","guid":"e8H8knFFQimHjUJKE7c5UA","children":[]},{"id":"84","parent":"81","text":"Inicio subagudo + afecto deprimido","guid":"ZlPthJyMR-SeNf8PQ0gAfA","children":[]},{"id":"85","parent":"81","text":"Aplicar GDS, Cornell si demencia","guid":"B8sPHxYMSBiYr-sdEmXIZQ","children":[]}]},{"id":"86","parent":"80","text":"Delirium (Inouye Lancet 2014)","guid":"-oKDgLXEQIOTK8bBg9Mvfw","children":[{"id":"87","parent":"86","text":"Inicio agudo (horas-días)","guid":"5ZoywjIvScKSItkuK_2vWw","children":[]},{"id":"88","parent":"86","text":"Curso fluctuante","guid":"bHefyCPZS2a5E3yDWrBGMA","children":[]},{"id":"89","parent":"86","text":"Alteración de atención y conciencia","guid":"ApYzkNpcS86ETeq_aPAu7Q","children":[]},{"id":"90","parent":"86","text":"Marcador de cerebro vulnerable → 30% progresan a demencia en 1 año","guid":"nh_QzHoqToWV7lbJ2ljs8g","children":[]},{"id":"91","parent":"86","text":"Considerar delirium de novo post-evento (ITU)","guid":"gks1cvs8SPyAOHaG6xCjbQ","children":[]}]},{"id":"92","parent":"80","text":"Comparación rápida","guid":"BY831jyKQa-KKrs8ZqL95g","children":[{"id":"93","parent":"92","text":"Demencia → insidioso, conciencia preservada, atención normal al inicio, quejas minimizadas, mucho esfuerzo, lento progresivo","guid":"L55lpGB_T9-01icBqZDjNg","children":[]},{"id":"94","parent":"92","text":"Depresión / pseudodemencia → subagudo, conciencia preservada, atención normal, quejas prominentes, POCO esfuerzo, continuo","guid":"HRIjDHJIT7S-HNPN2cdG0w","children":[]},{"id":"95","parent":"92","text":"Delirium → AGUDO, conciencia ALTERADA, atención disminuida, esfuerzo variable, FLUCTUANTE","guid":"z71XcKeCSu2_5g3FQJuf0Q","children":